			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751030201,
					"content": "#Ah, thanks a lot, {M#Big Bro}{F#Big Sis} Blondie! And your, uh... White... little sister? Either way, thanks for getting the Flowcurrent birds back ashore!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030202,
					"content": "Uh, and what were you doing here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030203,
					"content": "Iwai and I are waiting for the Flowcurrent Birds to return to shore. Not much else to do right now, anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030204,
					"content": "Hrroo, roooh!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iwai"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030205,
					"content": "Alright, come on, Iwai. You're a good kid, aren't you? Now be patient. There's no need to rush.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030206,
					"content": "Rroo...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iwai"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030207,
					"content": "Anyway, our original plan was to come down here to play. I mean, no one else usually comes down here other than Uncle Rongo anyway, so this is our super secret base... or something like that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030208,
					"content": "But we didn't think that these birds would steal a march on us today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030209,
					"content": "And that's why I've got all this fish ready to lure them over with. Flowcurrent Birds love the stuff!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030210,
						751030211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030210,
					"content": "So that's the situation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751030215,
					"content": "#Could be that they can't even see the fish I laid out from that far away. If you could lure them ashore, {M#Big Bro}{F#Big Sis}, they'd take the bait for sure!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030216,
					"content": "So, could you do the same thing you did earlier, and get all these Flowcurrent Birds to come ashore?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030217,
					"content": "Yup, yup, sure thing. Just leave it to us!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030211,
					"content": "I see, so \"Paimon\" is in fact a subspecies of Flowcurrent Bird...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751030212,
					"content": "Round like a roly-poly, and fond of fish... Yup, I can see where that's coming from.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030213,
					"content": "Mmm! Mmmm!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iwai"
				},
				{
