			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751030801,
					"content": "Wow, that's a ton of fish!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030802,
					"content": "#Wait, don't move, {M#Big Bro}{F#Big Sis} Blondie! Those are bait to attract Flowcurrent Birds!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030803,
					"content": "Uh, attract Flowcurrent Birds?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030804,
					"content": "Yeah! Iwai and I are waiting for the Flowcurrent Birds to return to shore. Not much else to do right now, anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030805,
					"content": "Hrroo, roooh!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iwai"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030806,
					"content": "Alright, come on, Iwai. You're a good kid, aren't you? Now be patient. There's no need to rush.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030807,
					"content": "Rroo...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iwai"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030808,
					"content": "Anyway, our original plan was to come down here to play. I mean, no one else usually comes down here other than Uncle Rongo anyway, so this is our super secret base... or something like that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030809,
					"content": "But we didn't think that these birds would steal a march on us today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030810,
					"content": "And that's why I've got all this fish ready to lure them over with. Flowcurrent Birds love the stuff!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030811,
						751030812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030811,
					"content": "Really? They don't seem all that attracted by it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030816
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751030816,
					"content": "Yeah. Could be that we're too far away, and they can't smell the fish? If only we could get 'em ashore somehow...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030817,
					"content": "If Uncle Rongo was here, he'd say something like <color=#00E1FFFF>\"Just boop them all ashore, why don't you?\"</color>... Iwai and I don't have the raw strength for that though. They'd blow us away instead, I'd bet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030818,
					"content": "#Hmm... Why don't we give that a try instead, {NICKNAME}? If we could get them to come ashore, they might be attracted to the fish then!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030812,
					"content": "I see, so \"Paimon\" is in fact a subspecies of Flowcurrent Bird...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751030813,
					"content": "Round like a roly-poly, and fond of fish... Yeah, I can see where you're coming from.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pania"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030814,
					"content": "Mmm! Mmmm!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iwai"
				},
				{
					"id": 751030815,
					"content": "What? No! Anyway, back to the point — you haven't lured any Flowcurrent Birds over at all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751030818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
